{"name":"Black Koala-Sheep","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you behave in a way that shocks and unsettles people from one of your backgrounds, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span> to <strong>intimidate</strong> them or <strong>push your luck</strong>.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"creativity","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.EYEsltI9O12j460A"},"cf":{"id":"temp_7grm5jafd1o"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895827172,"modifiedTime":1668896027032,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"2JgMZsOcoDKCw6L1"}
{"name":"Guardian MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;ve sworn to protect the people you care about, but balance is about finding your own place in the world as well. You know what you&rsquo;re capable of accomplishing, and you step up to show the world your unique strength. Tell the GM how you put your own life on the line to defeat a villain or danger that seems unstoppable.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.U2QCcOauZwR4AUF9"},"cf":{"id":"temp_wjw3uz25ln"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877855143,"modifiedTime":1668880530080,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"2XTyAK8gzJfru5LK"}
{"name":"Bold GQ","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you express vulnerability by admitting you were wrong or that you should have listened to someone you ignored?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.FKbkNC3BwL5Kz49o"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ggltm2gzi0h"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877413010,"modifiedTime":1668880480577,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"2lWXX8qsWxoaTUqE"}
