{"name":"Not Done Yet!","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>Once per session, when you are taken out, shift your balance towards center to stay up for one more combat exchange. After that exchange ends, you become helpless, unconscious, or otherwise incapable of continuing on, and are taken out as normal.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.qB743ApmO9zUxIl1"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ulf0qn6hxg"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877260774,"modifiedTime":1668880495377,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"3JO7cRP03gauSe1g"}
{"name":"Understanding Mien","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>Take +1 to <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span> (max +3).</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.YvKSD0JaPvCOCmCo"},"cf":{"id":"temp_slcvbx1yo8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894242359,"modifiedTime":1668894552283,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"3JRA2kEntBp7kZp3"}
{"name":"Out of Uniform","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you put on a disguised or physically altered persona to fool a community into thinking you&rsquo;re two different people, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span>. On a hit, people mostly unfamiliar with you won&rsquo;t connect your two personas. On a 7&ndash;9, this is the last time you can pull this trick without them catching on. On a miss, someone misidentifies you when you switch in a way that causes more trouble for you.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"creativity","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.268v0kjjvgpoZvq8"},"cf":{"id":"temp_slcvbx1yo8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894300153,"modifiedTime":1668894554777,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"3ePcTuhQiPbkWXtI"}
{"name":"Walls Can't Hold Me","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>rely on your skills and training</strong> to dangerously smash your way through walls or other obstacles, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span>.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"passion","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.uOnlH2b8uqdgWWOb"},"cf":{"id":"temp_xb32so9dzk"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668878073137,"modifiedTime":1669559548959,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"3tQPC39AY13ItRHE"}
{"name":"Icon GQ","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you accomplish a feat worthy of your burden and tradition?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.yu8jcLagvt9L739t"},"cf":{"id":"temp_04c01jib57g"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880058404,"modifiedTime":1668880674827,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"4KHkNwVtqMVIJch1"}
{"name":"You Missed Something","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you evaluate a friendly NPC&rsquo;s plan to get something done, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span>. On a hit, the GM tells you how you can drastically improve the chances of success; get it done, and they&rsquo;re sure to come through on top. On a 7&ndash;9, the problems inherent in the plan are fairly serious; the NPC will be resistant to making the necessary changes. On a miss, something about the plan throws you for a loop; the GM tells you what obvious danger the NPC is ignoring&hellip;or what they&rsquo;re hiding about their intent.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.zyeAQwQnSbK7L6mp"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ulf0qn6hxg"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877290597,"modifiedTime":1669559471182,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"4kf5HlZNj9gOtNmi"}
{"name":"Hammer MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>You can knock down every wall in the world, but balance isn&rsquo;t found in conquest and destruction. You know some walls need to stand to keep people safe. Tell the GM how you put yourself directly in the path of an inescapable threat to completely protect someone or something from harm.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.iCHVqzspPaAI8Ldn"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pyp3q8by06"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668878235921,"modifiedTime":1668880612485,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"4l8ORKhSOKKSFdlS"}
{"name":"Pillar GQ","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you help a companion find a significant success with their issues, or lead the group in finding a significant collective success?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.cNdk7MGprxt5bt5n"},"cf":{"id":"temp_z0hvsfadxen"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894466015,"modifiedTime":1668894512552,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"4yGtpES6NpmZ55y5"}
{"name":"Successor GQ","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you learn something meaningful or important about your lineage, its members, or its effects on the world and others?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.E3xP0fEN0wWvU1K4"},"cf":{"id":"temp_9kb88rhqb5d"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895975934,"modifiedTime":1668896003067,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"791dW1n3gW5XO0pM"}
{"name":"Legacy of Excellence","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<div>\n<div>You have dedicated yourself to accomplishing great, exciting deeds and becoming worthy of the trust others place in you. Choose four drives to mark at the start of play. When you fulfill a marked drive, strike it out, and mark growth or clear a condition. When your four marked drives are all struck out, choose and mark four new drives. When all drives are struck out, change playbooks or accept a position of great responsibility and retire from a life of adventure.</div>\n<br>\n<div>[] successfully lead your companions in battle</div>\n<div>[] give your affection to someone worthy</div>\n<div>[] start a real fight with a dangerous master</div>\n<div>[] do justice to a friend or mentor&rsquo;s guidance</div>\n<div>[] take down a dangerous threat all on your own</div>\n<div>[] openly outperform an authority figure</div>\n<div>[] save a friend&rsquo;s life</div>\n<div>[] get a fancy new outfit</div>\n<div>[] earn the respect of an adult you admire</div>\n<div>[] openly call out a friend&rsquo;s unworthy actions</div>\n<div>[] form a strong relationship with a new master</div>\n<div>[] stop a fight with calm words</div>\n<div>[] sacrifice your pride or love for a greater good</div>\n<div>[] defend an inhabited place from dire threats</div>\n<div>[] stand up to someone who doesn&rsquo;t respect you</div>\n<div>[] make a friend live up to a principle they have neglected</div>\n<div>[] show mercy or forgiveness to a dangerous person</div>\n<div>[] stand up to someone abusing their power</div>\n<div>[] tame or befriend a dangerous beast or rare creature</div>\n<div>[] pull off a ridiculous stunt</div>\n</div>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.trGZ4FtoYzbvtgyV"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ggltm2gzi0h"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877094601,"modifiedTime":1668880475318,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"7QyuG4PtqYplxTkc"}
{"name":"Badge of Authority","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>You have some badge or symbol of authority from your background, something that makes you someone to be listened to, if not well-liked or entirely respected. When you <strong>give an NPC an order based on that authority</strong> and their recognition of it, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>. On a hit, they do what you say. On a 7&ndash;9, they choose 1:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>They do it, but in lackluster fashion</li>\n<li>They say they need something first to be able to do it</li>\n<li>They do it, but they&rsquo;re going to talk to your superiors</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, the authority of your badge doesn&rsquo;t sway them; they do as they please and you take -1 forward against them.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"passion","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.9AuxSBGpCazERMjy"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ha4fkvb5hos"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877666894,"modifiedTime":1669559504251,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"7iiK7dIOUAUPFjJo"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_ggltm2gzi0h","name":"The Bold","color":"#111111","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"","sorting":"a","contents":["7QyuG4PtqYplxTkc","ogUecGRlrXGxAFgS","mbrHxVyI9bp7kFzZ","2lWXX8qsWxoaTUqE"],"children":["temp_ulf0qn6hxg"],"folderPath":[],"version":"2.5.5"}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880455520,"modifiedTime":1668899072101,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"9IZQDkAoonaB9lLq"}
{"name":"Steady Stance","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Assume a strong, steady stance; any foes engaged with you who chose to <strong>advance and attack</strong> this exchange must mark 1-fatigue. Negate the first condition or negative status inflicted on you in this exchange. If no conditions or negative statuses were inflicted on you in this exchange, become <em>Empowered</em> for the next exchange.</p>","approach":"defend-maneuver","basic":false,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.VS6twkz5sSWurkus"},"cf":{"id":"temp_9rsqwb8qsct"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895019428,"modifiedTime":1668895126406,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"9VopRxjhGneHlgZc"}
{"name":"Takes One to Know One","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>verbally needle someone</strong> by finding the weaknesses in their armor, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span>. On a hit, ask 1 question. On a 7&ndash;9, they ask 1 of you as well:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>What is your principle?</li>\n<li>What do you need to prove?</li>\n<li>What could shake your certainty?</li>\n<li>Whom do you care about more than you let on?</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Anyone who lies or stonewalls marks 2-fatigue. On a miss, your attack leaves you exposed; they may ask you any one question from the list, and you must answer honestly.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.xff3XLmyBuyLscjY"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ez8jkfjn4z8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668876142224,"modifiedTime":1669559377662,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"AB0AzFzW2UXq5bhZ"}
{"name":"A Warrior's Heart","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>live up to your principle</strong> while you have 3+ conditions marked, ignore your condition penalties. When you <strong>live up to your principle</strong> while you have 5 conditions marked, don&rsquo;t mark fatigue.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.DwBxGWDtjpPYXziJ"},"cf":{"id":"temp_slcvbx1yo8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894267364,"modifiedTime":1668894559624,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"ALUDmHjJt8lEfHvs"}
{"name":"Adamant MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;ve held true to a core of conviction even while getting your hands dirty to do what you deemed necessary. But balance means appreciating that other people are just as complex as you are, not merely obstacles or pawns. Tell the GM how you solve an intractable problem or calm a terrible conflict by relating to dangerous people on a human level.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.LLS64xV9A6hT8wKL"},"cf":{"id":"temp_lzcxwzqwg4"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668876407606,"modifiedTime":1668878347220,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"Ahrdnir8O9Vsf236"}
{"name":"It Doesn't Belong to You!","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>secretly pocket something owned by someone undeserving</strong>, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span>. On a hit, you swipe something from them (your choice) without them noticing you took it. On a 7&ndash;9, the thing you took isn&rsquo;t exactly what you thought it was; the GM will tell you how. On a miss, you grab the goods, but they notice&mdash;and pursue&mdash;as soon as you exit the scene.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"harmony","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.AmiptOY7cAIgedxj"},"cf":{"id":"temp_3tx5y5zb4hd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880283183,"modifiedTime":1668880731262,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"B8y5nntOUdwiJRNt"}
{"name":"Hammer GQ","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you make progress towards your goal against your adversary?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.xbNAvVDH5aqM6QeH"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pyp3q8by06"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668878261116,"modifiedTime":1668880613435,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"BNkl8vlexxMyYxdu"}
{"name":"Idealist GQ","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you improve the lives of a community of average citizens or help an ordinary person with their problems?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.hdX5GtS8rQq7HBU1"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pa1l6v3aljg"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880403648,"modifiedTime":1668880717892,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"Bg8eyXHakIqjak4m"}
