{"name":"The Strength of Your Heart","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you use Seize a Position, foes must mark 2-fatigue to block your movement.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.cuvoOOKFcqqtLNUG"},"cf":{"id":"temp_3tx5y5zb4hd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880195517,"modifiedTime":1668880730288,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"CK1guTwrQ9q57hzM"}
{"name":"Martyr Complex","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you have a total of 8 between conditions marked, highest principle, and fatigue marked, take +1 ongoing to all moves.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.icXiZetLYkj58rTz"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ha4fkvb5hos"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877796845,"modifiedTime":1668880546120,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"CTrjIT9JQHUomXbF"}
{"name":"Fueled By Anger","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>Mark Angry to use an additional basic or mastered technique when you <strong>advance and attack</strong>, even on a miss. While Angry is marked, take +1 ongoing to <strong>intimidate</strong> others.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.ByuupjKAPi13WYzi"},"cf":{"id":"temp_xb32so9dzk"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668878028122,"modifiedTime":1668880631003,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"CXdUjkroJJTCw5Rr"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_pyp3q8by06","name":"The Hammer","color":"#111111","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"","sorting":"a","contents":["tJCAgNj6GCK54FI2","4l8ORKhSOKKSFdlS","BNkl8vlexxMyYxdu","Y8xoROfhnTWrBCha"],"children":["temp_xb32so9dzk"],"folderPath":[],"version":"2.5.5"}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880598687,"modifiedTime":1668899077924,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"E7fh0DM6kA2twVfm"}
{"name":"Extraordinary Skill","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<p>You aren&rsquo;t just capable in your area of skill and training; you&rsquo;re astonishing. A true prodigy, excelling and learning far more quickly than anyone would expect. You start play with one additional mastered technique.</p>\n<p>Choose two areas in which your mastery is particularly impressive:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shaping</li>\n<li>Sensing</li>\n<li>Maneuvering</li>\n<li>Forcing</li>\n<li>Breaking</li>\n<li>Guarding</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you <strong>rely on your skills and training</strong>, use a combat stance, or otherwise trigger a move while using your mastery, ignore penalties from conditions or statuses.</p>\n<p>When you see someone use an unknown technique, if it is available to your skills and training, you may mark fatigue to shift your balance towards Excellence and take the technique as learned. <strong>You can only do this if your balance is at +1 Excellence or higher</strong>. You must still get a mastery condition from a master of the technique in order to move the technique from practiced to mastered.</p>\n<p>When you study with a teacher to learn a new technique, shift your balance towards Community and automatically learn the technique at the practiced level (skipping learned). <strong>You cannot learn techniques by studying with a teacher if your Balance is +0 Community or lower</strong>.</p>\n<p>When you spend time teaching a fellow companion a technique available to their skills and training, roll with Community. On a hit, you teach well enough; they learn the technique. On a 7&ndash;9, you get impatient or frustrated; choose to either take it out on them and inflict 2 conditions, or take it out on yourself and suffer 2 conditions. On a miss, you get too frustrated with their inadequacies; both of you suffer 2 conditions, and you can never try to teach them this technique again.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.vma09eWBtYe8vJMf"},"cf":{"id":"temp_9rsqwb8qsct"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894652267,"modifiedTime":1668895132911,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"EIDc5tevaZIuZRYa"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_xb32so9dzk","name":"Moves","color":"#000000","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","sorting":"a","contents":["3tQPC39AY13ItRHE","ysEXuuBgUE5OBaiI","qDg0jKW0PYHAXBBt","CXdUjkroJJTCw5Rr","UrBEJSIhNpSUXvJa"],"children":[],"folderPath":["temp_pyp3q8by06"]}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880603994,"modifiedTime":1668899001320,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"EgQN3bUypY43l8yR"}
{"name":"Challenge","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you throw a boastful challenge at an opponent before a fight, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>. On a hit, the challenge lands; if you win the fight, choose 1 from below. But your challenge goads them to impressive heights; they may choose 1 extra technique in every exchange for the duration of the fight. On a 10+, clear all fatigue at the end of the fight if you are victorious.</p>\n<p><strong>If you win, choose 1: your opponent must&hellip;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>teach you a technique of theirs, or help you master one you already know</li>\n<li>give you answers or an item of your choice</li>\n<li>acknowledge your superiority; shift your balance twice towards Excellence</li>\n<li>take your side in a future conflict</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, they dismiss your challenge and refuse to fight; they inflict a condition on you.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"passion","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.6qDS3CDReB4LC4po"},"cf":{"id":"temp_sjncv0uklh"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894892704,"modifiedTime":1668895117801,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"GNLXPDfMOyOexZfk"}
{"name":"Slippery Eel-Hound","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>defend and maneuver</strong> and choose to use Seize a Position to escape the scene, foes must mark an additional 2-fatigue to stop you, and you may bring any allies within reach when you retreat.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.DgL3KcAMyUK8BK5t"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ex8l91wc6z"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895318012,"modifiedTime":1668895575462,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"GWR0xfsaewqQEJpa"}
{"name":"A Tainted Past","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<p>You hail from a powerful, infamous lineage&mdash;one with an impressive and terrible reputation. Your lineage has had a massive impact on the world within the scope of your story&mdash;its reach extends over the whole scope, and everyone in the scope knows of it. Choose one domain that is the source of your lineage&rsquo;s power&mdash;the area in which they affected the world&mdash;and another into which they&rsquo;re now beginning to extend their reach.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>high society</li>\n<li>military command</li>\n<li>arts and entertainment</li>\n<li>land ownership</li>\n<li>organized crime</li>\n<li>spiritual authority</li>\n<li>state politics</li>\n<li>business and industry</li>\n<li>elite academics</li>\n<li>vigilante militias</li>\n<li>media and news</li>\n<li>vital supply chains</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Lineage Resources</h3>\n<p>You have access to your family&rsquo;s extensive stores of two of the following resources:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>obscure or forbidden knowledge</li>\n<li>introductions and connections</li>\n<li>servants or muscle</li>\n<li>high technology</li>\n<li>cold hard cash</li>\n<li>spiritual artifacts or tomes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Spend resources during the session to establish a boon you had previously asked for or obtained, something that your lineage&rsquo;s unique position and stores could provide: a vehicle, an invitation, a chest of jade coins, etc.</p>\n<h3>Humble Yourself</h3>\n<p>When you politely and obediently humble yourself before a powerful member of your lineage, roll with your Tradition. On a hit, you earn some credit; hold 3-resources. On a 7&ndash;9, their resources don&rsquo;t come without strings; you&rsquo;ll need to promise to fulfill some other obligation of your lineage, or let them shift your balance. On a miss, they&rsquo;re dissatisfied with your display; they&rsquo;re cutting you off until you fulfill some task they set to you.</p>\n<h3>Raid Your Lineage&rsquo;s Resources</h3>\n<p>When you raid your lineage&rsquo;s resources without their consent or knowledge, mark a condition and roll with your Progress. On a hit, hold 1-resource. On a 7&ndash;9, choose 1. On a 10+, choose 2.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&bull; You obtain an additional 1-resource</li>\n<li>&bull; You nab your goodies quietly; your lineage is none the wiser</li>\n<li>&bull; You steel yourself for what you&rsquo;re doing; avoid marking a condition</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, you&rsquo;re caught red-handed by a powerful member of your lineage who saw you coming.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.AmNNjHgqM5OOQGur"},"cf":{"id":"temp_9kb88rhqb5d"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895623120,"modifiedTime":1668896005649,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"HQAJf98QNyVqCPWX"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_9kb88rhqb5d","name":"The Successor","color":"#111111","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"","sorting":"a","contents":["uxdz5cwLRC1cr3Tr","791dW1n3gW5XO0pM","YQ6p64aJ5yC6OA2I","HQAJf98QNyVqCPWX"],"children":["temp_7grm5jafd1o"],"folderPath":[],"version":"2.5.5"}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895995465,"modifiedTime":1668899096801,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"HoEQM6QM1HWjOFt9"}
{"name":"Divert","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Step into the way of blows intended for allies; when any ally within reach suffers a blow this exchange, you can suffer it for them. If you also use Retaliate this exchange, deal an additional 1-fatigue each time.</p>","approach":"defend-maneuver","basic":false,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.p08gGAujGxrpephq"},"cf":{"id":"temp_wjw3uz25ln"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877819102,"modifiedTime":1668880534889,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"IE2MkAHc14Wj7KiE"}
{"name":"Bad Habits","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;ve picked up some bad habits over the years. Most other people are pretty set on trying to get you to stop. But maybe you can bring your friends along for the ride&hellip; Choose 4 bad habits you indulge:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Casual thievery and pickpocketing</li>\n<li>Vandalism or sabotag</li>\n<li>Trespassing</li>\n<li>Daredevil stunts</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Charming&rdquo; insults of dangerous people</li>\n<li>Cons</li>\n<li>Rabble-rousing</li>\n<li>Gambling</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Any necessary skills or talents related to your bad habits are considered to be part of your background.</p>\n<p>When you <strong>indulge a bad habit on your own</strong>, shift your balance toward Survival, and roll with Survival. On a hit, you pull it off and vent your frustrations; clear fatigue or conditions equal to your Survival (minimum 0). If you have no fatigue or conditions, mark growth. On a 10+, you also gain a windfall, a boon or opportunity&mdash;your bad habits paid off this time. On a miss, you&rsquo;re caught by someone dangerous or powerful, and they complicate your life.</p>\n<p>When you <strong>indulge a bad habit with a friend</strong>, shift your balance toward Friendship, and roll with Friendship. On a hit, you and your friend pull it off and grow closer; each of you makes the other Inspired. On a 10+, you also obtain some useful resource or information, and become Prepared. On a miss, something goes terribly awry; you can either take the heat yourself, or shift your Balance twice toward Survival and leave your friend in the lurch.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.99k64qKrpZWleQTb"},"cf":{"id":"temp_sahiwcgpd49"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895186236,"modifiedTime":1668895563990,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"IQC7RzJ0YDfYslju"}
{"name":"Suspicious Mind","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>watch a person carefully to figure them out</strong>, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span>. On a 7&ndash;9, hold 1. On a 10+, hold 2. Spend your hold, 1-for-1, to ask their player questions while you observe or interact with them; they must answer honestly.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Are you telling the truth?</li>\n<li>What are you truly feeling?</li>\n<li>What do you really want right now?</li>\n<li>What are you worried about?</li>\n<li>What are you about to do?</li>\n</ul>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.VYziDu3jNP5tAAZX"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ha4fkvb5hos"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877615554,"modifiedTime":1669559532038,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"J5iHAiIcKXGTSW32"}
{"name":"Is That the Best You Got?","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you goad or provoke an NPC into foolhardy action, say what you want them to do and roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>. On a 10+, they do it. On a 7&ndash;9, they can choose 1 instead:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>They do it, but more intensely than expected&mdash;you&rsquo;re taken off guard.</li>\n<li>They do it, but more carefully than expected&mdash;they gain an advantage against you.</li>\n<li>They don&rsquo;t do it, but they embarrass themselves&mdash;they mark a condition.</li>\n<li>They don&rsquo;t do it, but only catch themself at the last minute&mdash;they stumble and give you an opportunity.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, they are provoked to take harsh action, directly against you, in a way you&rsquo;re ill-prepared to counter.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"passion","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.hl22riyk6vk2dAND"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ex8l91wc6z"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895419167,"modifiedTime":1668895578422,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"JeeNQ7QRcK3KQtZb"}
{"name":"Judging a Rival","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you size someone up, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span>. On a 7&ndash;9, ask one. On a 10+, ask two.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>What are your weaknesses / strengths?</li>\n<li>How can I show you dominance / submission?</li>\n<li>What do you intend to do next?</li>\n<li>What do you wish I&rsquo;d do right now?</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, they notice you watching them; they may ask you 1 question from the list.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.aEAxwj4N7aqLxsnG"},"cf":{"id":"temp_sjncv0uklh"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894763325,"modifiedTime":1668895115826,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"Jz30wRoBNLAmW6Ku"}
{"name":"Use Their Momentum","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you are engaged with a large or powerful foe, mark fatigue to <strong>advance and attack</strong> with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>. If you do, you become <em>Prepared</em> and may also choose to use Retaliate as if it were an <strong>advance and attack</strong> technique.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.Gvz117y5oONltPpx"},"cf":{"id":"temp_342x39jxnpj"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668879746408,"modifiedTime":1669559598841,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"JzZ6zRof93epbAfx"}
{"name":"Never Turn My Back","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;ve seen sadness and grief. You&rsquo;re no stranger to loss and pain. But you know the world can be a better place. And nothing happens without good people fighting for what&rsquo;s right&hellip;</p>\n<p>You have a code&mdash;choose three ideals from the list to define it:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Always speak the truth</li>\n<li>Always stand up to bullies</li>\n<li>Always keep your promises</li>\n<li>Never strike the first blow</li>\n<li>Never deny a request for help</li>\n<li>Never leave a friend behind</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you live up to your ideals at a significant cost, someone who witnessed (or hears about) your sacrifice approaches you to affirm their allegiance to your group&rsquo;s purpose; write their name down on the list of allies below.</p>\n<h3>Allies</h3>\n<p>You can always <strong>plead</strong> with these allies&mdash;they always care what you think; they always open up to you if you <strong>guide and comfort</strong> them; and you can <strong>call on them to live up to their principles</strong> as if you had rolled a 10+ by erasing their name from your list of allies.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>...</li>\n</ul>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.6c7L5joAfcu1EBQJ"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pa1l6v3aljg"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880091036,"modifiedTime":1668880716204,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"KYRhfq20dRHfBQ6N"}
{"name":"Here's the Plan","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you commit to a plan you&rsquo;ve proposed to the group, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span>; take a -1 for each of your companions who isn&rsquo;t on board. On a 10+, hold 2. On a 7&ndash;9, hold 1. You can spend your hold 1-for-1 while the plan is being carried out to overcome or evade an obstacle, create an advantage, or neutralize a danger; if any of your companions abandon you while the plan is underway, you must mark a condition. On a miss, hold 1, but your plan goes awry when you encounter surprising opposition.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"creativity","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.DQg1Og3MAeUm4RYI"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ulf0qn6hxg"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877221645,"modifiedTime":1669559430363,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"L1imLZG5koEPINsw"}
{"name":"Taking Care of Business","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>lose your balance</strong> in a battle, instead of choosing one of the normal options, you may instead sacrifice yourself for your companions. If you do, your companions have a chance to get away without issue, and you are taken out (and possibly captured). You also choose 1:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Leave a clue your companions can follow</li>\n<li>Throw your companions one vulnerable object</li>\n<li>Provoke an opponent, shifting their balance twice</li>\n</ul>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.Na2wIbY4Qd5voplS"},"cf":{"id":"temp_slcvbx1yo8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894362050,"modifiedTime":1668894553693,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"LDXtvmTP8jkDjxxP"}
{"name":"Burden & Tradition","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<p>You are an icon of your burden and tradition. You are expected to be its exemplar, its single most important representative, trained up from a young age and saddled with the weight of history. You have been told that you are vital to the world.</p>\n<p>Choose <strong>3 responsibilities</strong> of your burden and tradition you are expected to assume:</p>\n<p><em>Protecting humanity from natural disasters and dark spirits; destroying dangerous creatures; overthrowing tyrants; serving and defending rightful rulers; performing rituals; providing aid and succor to the downtrodden; searching for hidden histories and artifacts; guarding nature from threats and destruction; safekeeping records and relics</em></p>\n<p>Choose <strong>3 prohibitions</strong> of your burden and tradition:</p>\n<p><em>Never refuse an earnest request for help; never express great emotion; never run from a fight; never start a fight; never deny someone knowledge or truth; never use your role for gain or profit; never intervene in a community without invitation; never withhold forgiveness; never steal or cheat</em></p>\n<h3>Live Up to Your Role</h3>\n<p>When you live up to your Role through the responsibilities of your burden and tradition despite opposition or danger, shift your balance toward Role instead of marking fatigue, and clear fatigue equal to your Role (minimum 0-fatigue).</p>\n<h3>Break Tradition</h3>\n<p>When you directly and openly break a prohibition of your burden and tradition, mark a condition, shift your balance twice towards Freedom, and mark growth</p>\n<h3>End of Session</h3>\n<p>At the end of each session, answer these after your standard growth questions.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Did I uphold a responsibility?<br></strong>If yes, shift balance toward Role and clear a condition.</li>\n<li><strong>Did I break a prohibition?<br></strong>If yes, shift balance toward Freedom. Underline one prohibition you broke during the session. If it&rsquo;s already underlined, cross it out&mdash;it doesn&rsquo;t mean anything to you to break it again.</li>\n</ul>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.xCGVxHPhN466PFBV"},"cf":{"id":"temp_04c01jib57g"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668879584078,"modifiedTime":1668880677090,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"LO57GfU2WsCMguOQ"}
{"name":"This Was a Victory","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you reveal that you have sabotaged a building, device, or vehicle right as it becomes relevant, mark fatigue and roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>. On a hit, your work pays off, creating an opportunity for you and your allies at just the right time. On a 7&ndash;9, the opportunity is fleeting&mdash;act fast to stay ahead of the consequences. On a miss, your action was ill-judged and something or someone you care about is hurt as collateral damage.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"passion","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.A3SKYWiJhhXr1ew3"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ez8jkfjn4z8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668876093838,"modifiedTime":1669559386098,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"LkJN1BZTLRVy4tsv"}
{"name":"Pillar MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>You define yourself as a part of a larger group, and in this moment, the group defines itself by you. You rally them, move among them, saying the right things and providing the right guidance so your group works with perfect cohesion and confidence. Tell the GM what you say to each of your companions so that in this moment, you overcome an indomitable challenge, together.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.GNrgbv9p9OLt9nJn"},"cf":{"id":"temp_z0hvsfadxen"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894450316,"modifiedTime":1668894511089,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"MDYARC0TEe1uMn9U"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_3tx5y5zb4hd","name":"Moves","color":"#000000","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","sorting":"a","contents":["xb6676DvpHJ1h9p7","PTEQdvdyCHEg4HBP","CK1guTwrQ9q57hzM","B8y5nntOUdwiJRNt","gtPByEDGCUfNEnuH"],"children":[],"folderPath":["temp_pa1l6v3aljg"]}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880700292,"modifiedTime":1668899025505,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"N4neAYq8okM3z3Z0"}
{"name":"Driven By Justice","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>Take +1 to <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span> (max +3).</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.kv5aRYH9BwQudCWg"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ez8jkfjn4z8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668876322696,"modifiedTime":1669559338281,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"NHuMDzNzC7UVYbsf"}
{"name":"Whatever I Can","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you<strong> spend time talking to the locals about their problems</strong>, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span>. On a hit, you hear about the most significant and serious problem at hand; the GM will tell you who it affects and what is the cause. On a 10+, you can ask a follow up question about the problem or cause; you take +1 ongoing when you act on the answer. On a miss, you wind up creating a whole new problem with your questions and ideas.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"harmony","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.d0YOafrrs99BTPDV"},"cf":{"id":"temp_3tx5y5zb4hd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880214869,"modifiedTime":1668880728692,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"PTEQdvdyCHEg4HBP"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_7grm5jafd1o","name":"Moves","color":"#000000","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","sorting":"a","contents":["fWAXrtfhDSKUzM9k","vHbc2NNARclpS1fJ","kBICShBUUnv7CLR9","2JgMZsOcoDKCw6L1","Qd6yQ2A4ezpS9h32"],"children":[],"folderPath":["temp_9kb88rhqb5d"]}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896011380,"modifiedTime":1668899004831,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"Q4joRP92uhQnddVG"}
{"name":"A Life of Regret","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>guide and comfort an NPC</strong> by apologizing and honestly promising to make amends for the harm they have suffered, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span>. If they choose not to open up to you, you do not take +1 forward against them. If they choose to open up to you, take +1 ongoing to attempts to take action to make amends.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.LGRz8MuRwULM3o16"},"cf":{"id":"temp_7grm5jafd1o"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895855494,"modifiedTime":1668896028360,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"Qd6yQ2A4ezpS9h32"}
{"name":"Pinpoint Aim","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Take the time you need to line up a perfect shot; become <em>Prepared</em>. In the next exchange, if you <strong>advance and attack</strong>, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span> or <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>, your choice. If you use Strike, you do not have to mark fatigue to choose what you inflict.</p>","approach":"defend-maneuver","basic":false,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.MhUYdRk8iUvpaJiJ"},"cf":{"id":"temp_lzcxwzqwg4"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668876353688,"modifiedTime":1668878346311,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"RgkfFXY9E0Czsy8i"}
{"name":"Protector's Burden","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<p>You take it upon yourself to protect the people around you in general, but you have someone in particular you keep safe.</p>\n<p><strong>Name your ward</strong> (choose a PC to start): ___</p>\n<p>When they mark a condition in front of you, mark fatigue or a condition. Your ward can always <strong>call on you to live up to your principle</strong>&mdash;without shifting their balance away from center&mdash;and they take +1 to do it.</p>\n<p>At the beginning of each session, roll, taking +1 for each yes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Do you believe your ward listens to you more often than not?</li>\n<li>Have you recently protected them or helped them with a problem?</li>\n<li>Is there an immediate threat to your ward that you are aware of?</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a 7&ndash;9, hold 1. On a 10+, hold 2. At any time, spend the hold to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Take a 10+ without rolling on any move to defend or protect them</li>\n<li>Track them down even if they are hidden or avoiding you</li>\n<li>Figure out what they&rsquo;re up to without them knowing</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, hold 1, but&hellip;you&rsquo;re drifting apart on different paths. By the end of the session, you must choose one:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Decide you&rsquo;re the only one who can keep them safe; shift your balance twice toward Self-Reliance and keep them as your ward</li>\n<li>Decide they can handle life without your protection; shift your balance twice toward Trust and switch your ward to a new person</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You may also switch your ward if they leave play or are no longer present for some reason. When you switch your ward, you can switch to an NPC (if the GM agrees).</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.cDvgCwxjcEXv6VG4"},"cf":{"id":"temp_wjw3uz25ln"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877481275,"modifiedTime":1668880528464,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"SnNt3tCdQIObER4N"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_wjw3uz25ln","name":"The Guardian","color":"#111111","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"","sorting":"a","contents":["SnNt3tCdQIObER4N","2XTyAK8gzJfru5LK","fM90nfPLhMrvUz9U","IE2MkAHc14Wj7KiE"],"children":["temp_ha4fkvb5hos"],"folderPath":[],"version":"2.5.5"}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880513860,"modifiedTime":1668899074999,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"T0VTlQl3ZVyDaXhk"}
{"name":"Concentration","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>Take +1 <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span> (max +3).</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.7u9zvb3wksQ8BQOv"},"cf":{"id":"temp_342x39jxnpj"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668879838357,"modifiedTime":1669559614775,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"TOcDSGv5GA2yszoN"}
{"name":"Wait and Listen","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>assess a situation</strong> while taking the time to use your extraordinary skills to absorb hidden or deep information, mark 1-fatigue, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span>, and become <em>Prepared</em>.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.ntUmTFl6aNSftRxL"},"cf":{"id":"temp_sjncv0uklh"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894852736,"modifiedTime":1668895112908,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"TOpsDrs8AXWkSt30"}
{"name":"The Lodestar","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<p>There&rsquo;s only one person you often let past your emotional walls.</p>\n<p><strong>Name your lodestar</strong> (choose a PC to start): ___</p>\n<p>You can shift your lodestar to someone new when they <strong>guide and comfort</strong> you and you open up to them, or when you <strong>guide and comfort</strong> them and they open up to you. If you do choose to shift your lodestar, clear a condition.</p>\n<p>When you <strong>shut down someone vulnerable to harsh words or icy silence</strong>, shift your balance toward Results and roll with Results. On a hit, they mark a condition and you may clear the same condition. On a 10+, they also cannot shift your balance or <strong>call you out</strong> for the rest of the scene. On a miss, they have exactly the right retort; mark a condition and they shift your balance. You cannot use this on your lodestar.</p>\n<p>When your lodestar <strong>shifts your balance</strong> or <strong>calls you out</strong>, you cannot resist it. Treat an NPC lodestar calling you out as if you rolled a 10+, and a PC lodestar calling you out as if they rolled a 10+.</p>\n<p>When you <strong>consult your lodestar for advice on a problem</strong> (or permission to use your preferred solution), roll with Restraint. On a 10+ take all three; on a 7&ndash;9 they choose two:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You see the wisdom of their advice. They shift your balance; follow their advice and they shift your balance again.</li>\n<li>The conversation bolsters you. Clear a condition or 2-fatigue.</li>\n<li>They feel at ease offering their opinion. They clear a condition or 2-fatigue.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, something about their advice infuriates you. Mark a condition or have the GM shift your balance twice.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.2PGWW1rxTQnsJBey"},"cf":{"id":"temp_lzcxwzqwg4"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668875927297,"modifiedTime":1668878345356,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"TQXXehhMkYqW5P4v"}
{"name":"Comprehend Your Foe","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>defend and maneuver</strong> against a foe whose balance principle you know, you may mark fatigue to roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span>.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"creativity","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.BtU58g4ITqw5DzTX"},"cf":{"id":"temp_xb32so9dzk"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668878139259,"modifiedTime":1669559573504,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"UrBEJSIhNpSUXvJa"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_342x39jxnpj","name":"Moves","color":"#000000","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","sorting":"a","contents":["eXX6vjgJGFHvHjYp","JzZ6zRof93epbAfx","kYk7R99K3429JDmc","TOcDSGv5GA2yszoN","bL3ssInifqDE2BzE"],"children":[],"folderPath":["temp_04c01jib57g"]}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880651140,"modifiedTime":1668899030441,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"Vau68zaKniw0FE6N"}
{"name":"Prodigy MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;ve always struggled to rely on other people&mdash;it feels like it makes you weak. But in this moment, connection to others is the very source of your strength. You call upon your commitment to the group to push yourself beyond your limits and do the impossible. Tell the GM how you accomplish a feat no one ever has before to help or save your friends.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.bjtWPwHzMP48alKY"},"cf":{"id":"temp_9rsqwb8qsct"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895055962,"modifiedTime":1668895127766,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"XYEa4vv7YmSfVY40"}
{"name":"Bringing Them Down","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<p>You always have an adversary, one who represents the things you&rsquo;re trying to smash through&mdash;tyranny, inequality, war; larger and more dangerous concepts that, to you at least, this one person embodies. Your adversary is someone significant and powerful&mdash;someone who actually deserves the amount of force you can bring to bear.</p>\n<p><strong>Name your adversary:</strong> ___</p>\n<p>Choose a goal you have for your adversary:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Capture them</li>\n<li>Discredit them</li>\n<li>Depose them</li>\n<li>Restrain them</li>\n<li>Expose them</li>\n<li>Exile them</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Take -1 ongoing to <strong>plead with</strong>, <strong>trick</strong>, or <strong>guide and comfort</strong> your adversary.</p>\n<h3>Changing Your adversary</h3>\n<p>You can change your adversary any time you mark a condition, or at the end of each session. When you do, choose an appropriate goal, and the GM shifts your balance twice to match your new adversary and your new goal. When you successfully accomplish your goal and defeat your adversary, take a growth advancement and choose a new adversary.</p>\n<h3>Fighting Your Adversary</h3>\n<p>When you enter into a fight against your adversary, clear all fatigue and become <em>Inspired</em>. When you select any combat approach against your adversary, mark fatigue to roll with conditions marked instead of your normal stat.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.e9mc2T4OkuZ9dsGJ"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pyp3q8by06"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877904215,"modifiedTime":1668880614549,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"Y8xoROfhnTWrBCha"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_sahiwcgpd49","name":"The Rogue","color":"#111111","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"","sorting":"a","contents":["dgXNnKUIIThr8bFX","jDn6lqS5Xw6elKcz","oPnKMMveNAcGQYHW","IQC7RzJ0YDfYslju"],"children":["temp_ex8l91wc6z"],"folderPath":[],"version":"2.5.5"}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895545470,"modifiedTime":1668899093696,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"YDhDvN6LwAz6NaIJ"}
{"name":"Break","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Target a foe&rsquo;s vulnerable equipment; render it useless or broken&mdash;possibly inflicting or overcoming a fictionally appropriate status.</p>","approach":"evade-observe","basic":false,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.tiWsT681lBkKzN4y"},"cf":{"id":"temp_9kb88rhqb5d"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895934589,"modifiedTime":1668896004399,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"YQ6p64aJ5yC6OA2I"}
{"name":"No Time For Feelings","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you have equal or fewer conditions marked than your highest principle, mark fatigue to push down your feelings for the rest of the scene and ignore condition penalties until the end of the scene. When you <strong>resist an NPC shifting your balance</strong>, mark a condition to roll with conditions marked (max +4). You cannot then choose to clear a condition by immediately proving them wrong.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.5FhaAB5PpPpyuurh"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ez8jkfjn4z8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668876209139,"modifiedTime":1668878361812,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"ZY9eJlU9Fzjkdmlx"}
{"name":"Disorient","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Pummel an engaged foe with quick blows; mark 1-fatigue to shift their balance away from center.</p>","approach":"advance-attack","basic":false,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.CM59jBYgZHmc0oyk"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pa1l6v3aljg"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880365294,"modifiedTime":1668880718926,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"ZhFY3Ve6fMR03TSd"}
{"name":"Prodigy GQ","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you express gratitude to a companion for their presence, support, or teaching?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.BewfsQtKWP3qNqme"},"cf":{"id":"temp_9rsqwb8qsct"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895071203,"modifiedTime":1668895130905,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"agqO17h2h4rXhHTF"}
{"name":"Bonzu Pippinpaddleopsicopolis… the Third","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>trick an NPC</strong> by assuming a silly disguise or fake identity, mark Insecure to treat your roll as if it was a 12+. If Insecure is already marked, mark 2-fatigue instead.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.n7KvpPcqFQmDBs2T"},"cf":{"id":"temp_342x39jxnpj"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668879805024,"modifiedTime":1668880678094,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"bL3ssInifqDE2BzE"}
{"name":"Catch a Liar","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you are suspicious of someone, write their name here:</p>\n<p>_____</p>\n<p>You cannot write another until you have made them admit their guilt and misdeeds in front of an audience, or until you no longer seek to uncover their secrets.</p>\n<p>When they admit their guilt and misdeeds in front of an audience, clear their name from this move. When you no longer seek to uncover their secrets, you may mark a condition to clear their name from this move.</p>\n<p>When you expose that person&rsquo;s lies or wrong-doing, clear all your fatigue and up to two conditions. When you try to intimidate them into admitting their real crimes by using actual evidence, you can eliminate one additional option from the list on any hit before they choose.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.dsPDOt3T7zNjOIfv"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ha4fkvb5hos"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877728070,"modifiedTime":1668880548122,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"d8KkuaYRAFMlDJXb"}
{"name":"Icon MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>Others have laid a path for you that you cannot escape, but balance means you understand the limits of their vision. You make the role your own in this moment, charting a new path for yourself and your tradition. Tell the GM how your new understanding of your burdens forges a new way forward for everyone.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.gl8wDWG1T5hC0wDL"},"cf":{"id":"temp_04c01jib57g"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880026539,"modifiedTime":1668880673635,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"dKwKuLu6SmPsjf5U"}
{"name":"Sweep the Leg","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>You attack where an enemy is weakest or most off-balance; if your foe has a total of 3 or more fatigue and conditions marked, inflict 2-fatigue. If your foe has fewer than 3 total fatigue and conditions marked, inflict 2-fatigue, but you must 1-mark fatigue as well.</p>","approach":"advance-attack","basic":false,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.qGsjKr0NfMhcozzV"},"cf":{"id":"temp_sahiwcgpd49"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895482679,"modifiedTime":1668895559582,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"dgXNnKUIIThr8bFX"}
{"name":"You're Not My Master!","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>resist an NPC shifting your balance</strong>, roll +2 instead of +0.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.cj3CW2qNQMUcHfpN"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ex8l91wc6z"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895343230,"modifiedTime":1668895573870,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"eStlPtKjOwLtPlHa"}
{"name":"Yip Yip!","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>You have an animal companion large enough to ride. Name them and choose their species:</p>\n<p><em>Sky bison, polar bear-dog, eel-hound, cat-gator, elephant-mandrill, gemsbok-bull, shirshu, komodo-rhino, sabertooth moose-lion, flying boar, walrus-yak, flying fish-opotamus</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>When you fight beside your animal companion, mark 1-fatigue to become <em>Favored</em> for an exchange.</li>\n<li>When something hurts your animal companion, mark a condition.</li>\n<li>When you and your friends travel via your animal companion, everyone clears all fatigue.</li>\n</ul>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.lYTDP8Qus4mWsOhs"},"cf":{"id":"temp_342x39jxnpj"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668879921802,"modifiedTime":1668880667991,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"eXX6vjgJGFHvHjYp"}
{"name":"Surprising Entrance","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>trick someone</strong>&nbsp;by using your skills to disappear and reappear somewhere else within the same scene, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span>.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.2ogORRrz2W7Trs7i"},"cf":{"id":"temp_sjncv0uklh"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894969273,"modifiedTime":1668895114358,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"f09zWWsmnP3ifW3h"}
{"name":"Guardian GQ","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you pursue a desire or goal of your own, outside of protecting others?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.vkAe64OM9ysyyryX"},"cf":{"id":"temp_wjw3uz25ln"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877878982,"modifiedTime":1668880531265,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"fM90nfPLhMrvUz9U"}
{"name":"Worldly Knowledge","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>Your upbringing expanded your horizons, skillsets, and contacts. Choose another training and another background.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.39jLlJnnMoKsjr0s"},"cf":{"id":"temp_7grm5jafd1o"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895913894,"modifiedTime":1668896018743,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"fWAXrtfhDSKUzM9k"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_9rsqwb8qsct","name":"The Prodigy","color":"#111111","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"","sorting":"a","contents":["9VopRxjhGneHlgZc","XYEa4vv7YmSfVY40","agqO17h2h4rXhHTF","EIDc5tevaZIuZRYa"],"children":["temp_sjncv0uklh"],"folderPath":[],"version":"2.5.5"}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895092497,"modifiedTime":1668899090380,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"goFTK02Y0lN2OoRZ"}
{"name":"Can't Knock Me Down","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you are <strong>engaged in combat with superior opposition and openly refuse to back down or flee</strong>, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span> for the rest of the battle whenever you <strong>defend and maneuver</strong>; you cannot choose to escape the scene by using Seize a Position for the rest of the fight.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"harmony","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.nDX5N1EJxDw4R5he"},"cf":{"id":"temp_3tx5y5zb4hd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880308079,"modifiedTime":1668880732425,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"gtPByEDGCUfNEnuH"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_sjncv0uklh","name":"Moves","color":"#000000","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","sorting":"a","contents":["TOpsDrs8AXWkSt30","f09zWWsmnP3ifW3h","Jz30wRoBNLAmW6Ku","GNLXPDfMOyOexZfk","uyJENe4nDaAJCfkz"],"children":[],"folderPath":["temp_9rsqwb8qsct"]}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895097546,"modifiedTime":1668899017227,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"j4zlwOP6EO7NP9Iz"}
{"name":"Rogue MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>You learned early on that you had to do what you needed to survive, and that sometimes that meant you lost friends. Now, you find a new balance: rule-breaking isn&rsquo;t something that just drives people away&mdash;it&rsquo;s something you can use constructively, with your friends! Tell the GM how you lead your companions to break all the rules and accomplish an incredible feat.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.8rFF3bd8vE2q0gWl"},"cf":{"id":"temp_sahiwcgpd49"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895505000,"modifiedTime":1668895560856,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"jDn6lqS5Xw6elKcz"}
{"name":"Walk This Way","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you make over, disguise, and/or coach your friends to fit in with a specific crowd appropriate to one of your backgrounds, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span>. On a 10+, the performance is flawless; you gain access to wherever you wanted to fit in while attracting little suspicion. On a 7&ndash;9, you fool nearly everyone; there&rsquo;s only a single gatekeeper who asks any questions or stands in your way. On a miss, the only way to get the access you desired is for one of your friends to take on an uncomfortable, dangerous, or attention- grabbing role.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"creativity","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.uewCyXzbVy9HrPSF"},"cf":{"id":"temp_7grm5jafd1o"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895889907,"modifiedTime":1668896025477,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"kBICShBUUnv7CLR9"}
{"name":"Otter-Penguins, Unagi, and Hot Springs","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you visit a new inhabited location you might know about, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span>. On a 7&ndash;9, ask 1. On a 10+, ask 2. PCs who interact with one of the answers clear 1-fatigue or mark growth.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>What&rsquo;s the best local pastime?</li>\n<li>What interesting locations are nearby?</li>\n<li>Who is the most famous person here?</li>\n<li>What special tradition is prized by locals?</li>\n<li>What&rsquo;s the most interesting legend locals recount about this place?</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, tell the GM what you expected to find; they will tell you how this place is different!</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.Dlm99iTUc827x9I7"},"cf":{"id":"temp_342x39jxnpj"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668879857489,"modifiedTime":1669559605364,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"kYk7R99K3429JDmc"}
{"name":"Bold MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>The greatest heroes of your age may have overwhelming confidence, but balance isn&rsquo;t about pursuing greatness for the sake of greatness. You find a way to stand with your companions like no one else ever could. Tell the GM how you strike down an impossibly strong enemy or obstacle to protect your friends from harm as the best version of yourself.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.yfjjDFcGh40YJrkv"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ggltm2gzi0h"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877392547,"modifiedTime":1668880478582,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"mbrHxVyI9bp7kFzZ"}
{"name":"Casing the Joint","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>assess a situation</strong>, add these questions to the list. You may always ask one extra question from these options, even on a miss.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>What here is most valuable or interesting to me?</li>\n<li>Who or what is most vulnerable to me?</li>\n<li>Who here is in control/wealthiest/has the most power?</li>\n</ul>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.y0sqiUjaVXyA9s7s"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ex8l91wc6z"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895381487,"modifiedTime":1668895580023,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"mcZVQeEsZ5akI9cv"}
{"name":"Squad Leader","type":"feature","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/feature.png","system":{"description":"<p>You were the leader of a small group of 10 or so well-trained warriors from a recognized and noble tradition.</p>\n<p><strong>Where does your squad call home?</strong></p>\n<p>_______________________________</p>\n<p><strong>Which are the most well known traits of your squad?</strong> (choose up to 3):</p>\n<p><em>our weapons, our fighting style, our battle cry, our costumes, our legends, our purpose</em></p>\n<p><strong>What does your squad value?</strong> (choose 2):</p>\n<p><em>Excellence, Justice, Duty, Mercy, Tradition, Protection</em></p>\n<p>Despite being the leader, you chose to travel with your new companions for the time being, until you&rsquo;ve achieved this group&rsquo;s purpose.</p>\n<p><strong>Choose where your team is without you:</strong></p>\n<p><em>protecting the team&rsquo;s home while you are away; protecting a powerful figure; temporarily disbanded or exiled; training and preparing for something important; journeying and doing good works throughout your scope; escorting important travelers; stationed at an important location; performing traditional or ceremonial duties</em></p>\n<p>Within any group, you serve a role both subtle and overt, sometimes leading the team, sometimes helping it glue itself together. You earn Team through your leadership style, and you spend Team through your support style. At the end of each session, you may change 1 style of leadership and 1 style of support.</p>\n<p>Choose 2 styles of leadership.</p>\n<p><strong>Earn 1-Team when&hellip;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Firm</strong>: &hellip;you openly <strong>call on a companion to live up to their principle</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Inspiring</strong>: &hellip;you <strong>live up to your principle</strong> and roll a hit.</li>\n<li><strong>Diplomatic</strong>: &hellip;you <strong>plead with an NPC</strong> for help and roll a 10+.</li>\n<li><strong>Empathetic</strong>: &hellip;you <strong>guide and comfort</strong> a companion and they open up to you.</li>\n<li><strong>Guidance</strong>: &hellip;you <strong>assess a situation</strong> and give a companion instructions based on the answers</li>\n<li><strong>Indomitable</strong>: &hellip;you roll a hit when you <strong>resist shifting your balance</strong> or you <strong>deny a callout</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose 2 styles of support.</p>\n<p><strong>Spend 1-Team when&hellip;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Comforting</strong>: &hellip;you spend time one-on-one in a quiet moment with a companion to clear a condition from them.</li>\n<li><strong>Invigorating</strong>: &hellip;you rally a companion to action in a tense moment to clear 2-fatigue from them.</li>\n<li><strong>Defending</strong>: &hellip;you are within reach of a companion in combat to clear a negative status from them.</li>\n<li><strong>Bolstering</strong>: &hellip;you help another companion to give them a +1 to their roll, after the roll.</li>\n<li><strong>Encouraging</strong>: &hellip;you openly endorse a friend <strong>living up to their principle</strong> to shift their balance toward that principle.</li>\n<li><strong>Trusting</strong>: &hellip;you openly endorse a friend <strong>resisting shifting their balance</strong> to give them +2, after the roll.</li>\n</ul>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.4rkz1YzvKcQ7HQfM"},"cf":{"id":"temp_z0hvsfadxen"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668893985645,"modifiedTime":1668894507920,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"mjV5pI2jw8kDeXyi"}
