{"name":"Furrowed Brow","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>Take +1 <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span> (max +3).</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.PYK7ohHVjahjfPqk"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ha4fkvb5hos"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877778769,"modifiedTime":1669559519292,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"pLC1hO2j3kibjK5z"}
{"name":"Slide Around the Blow","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>You move perfectly, slipping past strikes and demanding an opponent&rsquo;s attention; a foe you are engaged with must remain engaged with you and can only use techniques against you in the next exchange. If no foe is engaged with you, you may slip through the fight to engage a new foe (no foe may mark fatigue to stop you).</p>","approach":"evade-observe","basic":false,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.i01OgkuIitFryUE0"},"cf":{"id":"temp_z0hvsfadxen"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894413099,"modifiedTime":1668894509696,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"prZAe3JwyCe3NoHz"}
{"name":"Wall of Perfection","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Create a perfect wall of defense around yourself and any allies directly next to you; mark 1-fatigue to block a single attack towards the wall or keep an enemy at bay who tries to penetrate the wall.</p>","approach":"defend-maneuver","basic":false,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.wLoZRNXuDI3RXMyh"},"cf":{"id":"temp_04c01jib57g"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668879998148,"modifiedTime":1668880669670,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"q9BluRUMVN61OFjC"}
