{"name":"Punch Where It Matters","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>assess a situation</strong>, you can always ask, \"Who or what here is most vulnerable to me?\", even on a miss. Remember to take +1 ongoing to act in accordance with the answer.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.KLzGdlQNzvsG9Z9l"},"cf":{"id":"temp_xb32so9dzk"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668878105946,"modifiedTime":1668880630002,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"qDg0jKW0PYHAXBBt"}
{"name":"Roguish Charm","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>plead with an NPC</strong> or <strong>guide and comfort</strong> someone by flattering them and empathizing with them, mark 1-fatigue to roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span>.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"creativity","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.sTl4KlZHh6tkz32u"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ex8l91wc6z"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895282139,"modifiedTime":1668895576737,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"qFxLnCR95wc0J3BF"}
{"name":"I Don't Hate You","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>guide and comfort</strong> someone in an awkward, understated, or idiosyncratic fashion, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span> if you mark Insecure or Insecure is already marked.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"passion","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.sJP6swXAEaeiZFwE"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ez8jkfjn4z8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668876280651,"modifiedTime":1669559361347,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"qaomT7K2BXWROHEz"}
{"name":"Overwhelm","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Throw a punch with all your weight behind it; mark 3-fatigue to inflict <em>Stunned</em> on an engaged foe.</p>","approach":"advance-attack","basic":false,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.F8DKNQrkt9PAAuZV"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pyp3q8by06"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668878204371,"modifiedTime":1668880611338,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"tJCAgNj6GCK54FI2"}
