{"name":"Adamant GQ","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you seek support or guidance from others?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.p1B76SKWPwlUUPmX"},"cf":{"id":"temp_lzcxwzqwg4"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668876447296,"modifiedTime":1668878348046,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"uAX8K0fsbxHEocZs"}
{"name":"Successor MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>You may never escape the legacy of your family, but balance allows you to learn from them without defining yourself in their image. You call upon a resource of your family to innovate a new solution to an intractable problem, never forgetting who you are in the face of incredible danger. Tell the GM how you knock down obstacles that seem impossible to overcome and save the day.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.ZdOvK75z5x4IhY0v"},"cf":{"id":"temp_9kb88rhqb5d"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895955590,"modifiedTime":1668896001799,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"uxdz5cwLRC1cr3Tr"}
{"name":"An Open Mind","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>You can learn techniques from other skills and trainings, as long as you have a teacher. You can learn up to three such techniques, total. Take a +1 on the training move to learn such techniques.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.b8tvCgZdkOeB0rie"},"cf":{"id":"temp_sjncv0uklh"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894825424,"modifiedTime":1668895119731,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"uyJENe4nDaAJCfkz"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_ex8l91wc6z","name":"Moves","color":"#000000","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","sorting":"a","contents":["eStlPtKjOwLtPlHa","GWR0xfsaewqQEJpa","qFxLnCR95wc0J3BF","JeeNQ7QRcK3KQtZb","mcZVQeEsZ5akI9cv"],"children":[],"folderPath":["temp_sahiwcgpd49"]}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895551677,"modifiedTime":1668899011737,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"v5uniiKKOwdZlqvm"}
{"name":"Way of the Future","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>Take +1 <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span> (max +3).</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.zobJSGh0b6AxkKsz"},"cf":{"id":"temp_7grm5jafd1o"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668895811082,"modifiedTime":1668896024284,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"vHbc2NNARclpS1fJ"}
{"name":"Idealist MoB","type":"moment-of-balance","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/moment-of-balance.png","system":{"description":"<p>The pain of the world can be overwhelming, but balance brings peace. You bring everything around you to a stop&mdash; villains, arguments, disaster&mdash;and set the world right. Tell the GM how your compassionate actions end a conflict utterly and completely.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.agyvcm94zMN5vatk"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pa1l6v3aljg"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880389039,"modifiedTime":1668880715135,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"wjWRuQiMGY6aSI0o"}
{"name":"Your Rules Stink","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>stand up to an adult by telling them their rules are stupid</strong>, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>. On a hit, they are surprised by your argument; they must shift their balance or offer you a way forward, past the rules. On a 10+, both. On a miss, your efforts to move them only reveal how strongly they believe in the system&mdash;mark a condition as their resistance leaves you reeling.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"passion","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.JS0TSV6cfFqQ2aoF"},"cf":{"id":"temp_3tx5y5zb4hd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668880252286,"modifiedTime":1668880727221,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"xb6676DvpHJ1h9p7"}
{"name":"Fighting Like Dancing","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>advance and attack</strong> against a group of foes&mdash;or a foe who has previously defeated you&mdash;roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"harmony","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.m1f4jRLsFRq5Uqok"},"cf":{"id":"temp_slcvbx1yo8"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668894328169,"modifiedTime":1668894558477,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"yiZ0d8ABkBxZN8wj"}
{"name":"Best Friend","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>Your best friend is small, fuzzy, and dependable. Unlike all your other relationships, this one is simple and true. You can understand and communicate with your small companion and&mdash;although they may give you a hard time now and again&mdash;they are always there when you need them most. Whenever your pal could help you <strong>push your luck</strong>, mark fatigue to roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span> instead of <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>. If your pet ever gets hurt, mark a condition.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"creativity","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.p9PyhVgvuA0JSMqa"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ulf0qn6hxg"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877166237,"modifiedTime":1669559409177,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"ylHNA3oNHUgBG6Jy"}
{"name":"Stand and Fight!","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>provoke an NPC opponent into attacking you</strong>, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>. On a hit, they&rsquo;re coming at you specifically. On a 10+, you&rsquo;re ready for them; clear a condition or become <em>Prepared</em>. On a miss, they take advantage of your provocation to strike a blow where you least expect it.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"passion","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.T547bldJtuaTQk1Q"},"cf":{"id":"temp_xb32so9dzk"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668878166627,"modifiedTime":1669559555339,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"ysEXuuBgUE5OBaiI"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_ez8jkfjn4z8","name":"Moves","color":"#000000","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","sorting":"a","contents":["LkJN1BZTLRVy4tsv","AB0AzFzW2UXq5bhZ","ZY9eJlU9Fzjkdmlx","qaomT7K2BXWROHEz","NHuMDzNzC7UVYbsf"],"children":[],"folderPath":["temp_lzcxwzqwg4"]}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668878336244,"modifiedTime":1668898990154,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"zJlidxFXpIvhBReR"}
{"name":"Straight Shooter","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you tell an NPC the blunt, honest truth about what you really think of them and their plans, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span>. On a hit, they&rsquo;ll look upon your honesty favorably; they&rsquo;ll answer a non-compromising question honestly and grant you a simple favor. On a 7&ndash;9, they also give you an honest assessment of how they see you; mark a condition. On a miss, you&rsquo;re a bit too honest&mdash;they&rsquo;re either furious or genuinely hurt.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"playbook"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.HMEIJStEbBddknh0"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ulf0qn6hxg"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.16","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668877324191,"modifiedTime":1669559450219,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"znTvZKyNWU5daDpm"}
